00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.860
that can be made
for business users

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:32.380
to be able to succeed
in model training.

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:35.200
And this is really where
our smart ML feature

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:37.450
is leveraged to
its T, when we go

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:40.525
to deploy these no-code
model training cycles.

