function for the user.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:36.340
But it's not just being able
to take those logical defaults.

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:40.420
It's really about monitoring
the training while we're

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:43.720
training in Vertex
AI and identifying

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.370
