00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:55.690
worked during training.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:58.750
But really, we can
budget an amount of time,

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:01.060
and then smart ML
will stop the training

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:04.870
when we have achieved a
productionalized accuracy

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:08.680
and a model performance
across the dataset

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:09.970
