into a BI workflow

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:30.330
or an anomaly detection workflow
that's required in some cases,

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:34.050
where we're structuring the
data from video in a way where

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:36.330
it now can be consumed by
traditional models that

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.460
are non-computer vision models.

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:44.490
This prediction container is
enabled to do that by Pub/Sub.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:47.250
Every prediction container
from our perspective,

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.020
when we deploy to
a custom container,

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:52.170
serves up a message
into the Pub/Sub,

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:58.440
where now a developer
or a BI integration

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:01.950
can now consume that message and
leverage that within a larger

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:03.060
ecosystem.

