connector with Pub/Sub

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:19.410
up as a messaging bus
in between is powerful,

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:21.030
because now any
number of applications

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:25.410
can just subscribe to that
model and get the predictions.

